WHERE IT LIVES. **Not** under https://ekr.financnasprava.sk/Formulare/XSD/,
where every other schema in this repository comes from: 22 plausible names were
probed there (uzfov14, UZFOv14, uvfov13, uvfo1v13, …) and every one returned
404 with the authority's ~1 245-byte HTML error page, while a control fetch of
kv_dph_2025.xsd on the same path returned 200. The schema is served beside the
eForm instead, and the eForm names it itself:
`if (… 'xsd') return 'form.300.sk.xsd';` in
https://pfseform.financnasprava.sk/Formulare/eFormVzor/UV/form.300.html

WHAT THIS SCHEMA IS. The whole JÚ závierka in one document: root `dokument`
with `hlavicka` + `telo`, the telo carrying `ucFo1/r01…r12`
(optionalDecimalType, one column) beside `ucFo2/r01…r21` (riadokType = s1
bezprostredne predchádzajúce obdobie, s2 bežné obdobie). So the tlačivo's four
printed columns collapse to two in XML: rows 01–15 use s1/s2 for the majetok
columns 1/2, rows 16–21 for the záväzky columns 3/4.

HOW IT STAMPS ITSELF — a vintage only: `<xsd:documentation>UzFo_2014
</xsd:documentation>`. No version attribute and no fixed-value element, so
nothing in the file would move if FS SR revised it in place. That is why the
digest above is pinned and a test asserts it.

